## 👥 Work in Our Team

Collaboration and communication are key to working effectively in our team. We value **flexibility** and encourage you to shape your role in a way that works best for you.

**✅ Getting Started**
- [ ] Subscribe to our **[calendar](https://digital-work-lab.github.io/handbook/docs/02.calendar.html)** for key dates, meetings, and events
- [ ] Join regular team meetings (co-working sessions in the calendar) and **send calendar invites** when needed

**📌 Team Processes & Collaboration**
- [ ] Read our [Standard Operating Procedures (SOP)](https://digital-work-lab.github.io/handbook/docs/10-lab/10_processes/10.04.sop.html) to learn about our collaboration workflows
- [ ] Read the [team responsisbilities](https://digital-work-lab.github.io/handbook/docs/03.responsibilities.html) to understand your role and responsibilities
- [ ] Meet the team in one of the co-working sessions, and join us for lunch 🍽

**We encourage you to ask questions, share ideas, and actively participate in team discussions. 🚀**

