## 🏢 Our Handbook

Our **handbook** serves as a central resource for everything related to our team’s work, values, and processes. It is designed to help you navigate policies, best practices, and expectations within the **Digital-Work Team**. The handbook is a **living document**, meaning it evolves based on team contributions and feedback.

To get started, explore the following key sections:

- [ ] Read our [goals and values](https://digital-work-lab.github.io/handbook/docs/00.goals.html)
- [ ] Read our sections on [security](10.72.security.html) and [emergency procedures](10.73.emergencies.html)
- [ ] Read our [handbook](https://digital-work-lab.github.io/handbook/docs/10-lab/10_processes/10.10.handbook.html) section to understand how to contribute to the handbook.

**Ask questions and help to revise the handbook! 🛠️**

